        <p><seg source="#source-871-874">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-874-913"><rb>参謀本部</rb><rt>さんぼうほんぶ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-913-937"><rb>編纂</rb><rt>へんさん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-937-940">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940-958"><rb>地図</rb><rt>ちづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-958-961">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-961-976"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-976-1000"><rb>繰開</rb><rt>くりひら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1000-1006">いて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1006-1018"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1018-1045">るでもなからう、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1045-1060"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1060-1081">つたけれども、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1081-1096"><rb>余</rb><rt>あま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1096-1102">りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1102-1117"><rb>道</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1117-1132">ぢやから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1132-1144"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1144-1147">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1147-1162"><rb>触</rb><rt>さは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1162-1171">るさへ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1171-1186"><rb>暑</rb><rt>あつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1186-1201">くるしい、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1201-1216"><rb>旅</rb><rt>たび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1216-1219">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1219-1240"><rb>法衣</rb><rt>ころも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1240-1243">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1243-1258"><rb>袖</rb><rt>そで</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1258-1276">をかゝげて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1276-1297">