        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2629-2653"><rb>旅僧</rb><rt>たびそう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2653-2656">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2656-2668"><rb>然</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2668-2683">ういつて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2683-2713"><rb>握拳</rb><rt>にぎりこぶし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2713-2716">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2716-2743"><rb>両方</rb><rt>りやうはう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2743-2761"><rb>枕</rb><rt>まくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2761-2764">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2764-2776"><rb>乗</rb><rt>の</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2776-2782">せ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2782-2797"><rb>其</rb><rt>それ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2797-2800">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2800-2818"><rb>額</rb><rt>ひたひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2818-2821">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2821-2836"><rb>支</rb><rt>さゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2836-2848">へながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2848-2869"><rb>俯向</rb><rt>うつむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2869-2880">いた。</seg></p>
