草履</rb><rt>ざうり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129563-129566">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129566-129578"><rb>穿</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129578-129589">いた。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-129589-129604">するとお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129604-129616"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129616-129631">きなさい、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129631-129652"><rb>婦女</rb><rt>をんな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129652-129655">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129655-129676"><rb>足駄</rb><rt>あしだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129676-129679">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129679-129691"><rb>穿</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129691-129703">きながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129703-129715"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129715-129718">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129718-129730"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129730-129753">つてくれます。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129756-129774"><rb>忽</rb><rt>たちま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129774-129777">ち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129777-129789"><rb>身</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129789-129792">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129792-129807"><rb>軽</rb><rt>かる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129807-129828">くなつたやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129828-129843"><rb>覚</rb><rt>おぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129843-129852">えて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129852-129867"><rb>訳</rb><rt>わけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129867-129873">なく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129873-129891"><rb>後</rb><rt>うしろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129891-129894">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129894-129912"><rb>従</rb><rt>したが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129912-129933">ふて、ひよいと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129933-129945"><rb>那</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129945-129948">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129948-129972"><rb>孤家</rb><rt>ひとつや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129972-129975">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129975-129993"><rb>背戸</rb><rt>せど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-129993-129996">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-129996-130011"><rb>端</rb><rt>はた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-130011-130014">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-130014-130026"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-130026-130034">た。</seg></p>
