        <p><seg source="#source-130129-130141">（やあ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-130141-130162"><rb>大分</rb><rt>だいぶ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-130162-130180"><rb>手間</rb><rt>てま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-130180-130183">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-130183-130195"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-130195-130204">れると</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-130204-130219"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-130219-130231">つたに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-130231-130261"><rb>御坊様</rb><rt>おばうさま</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-130261-130276"><rb>旧</rb><rt>もと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-130276-130279">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-130279-130297"><rb>体</rb><rt>からだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-130297-130300">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-130300-130315"><rb>帰</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-130315-130344">らつしやつたの、）</seg></p>
