        <p><seg source="#source-153332-153335">（</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153335-153350"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153350-153374">でございますか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153374-153392"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153392-153395">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153395-153410"><rb>胸</rb><rt>むね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153410-153413">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153413-153428"><rb>支</rb><rt>つか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153428-153452">へましたやうで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153452-153473"><rb>些少</rb><rt>ちつと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153473-153476">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153476-153488"><rb>欲</rb><rt>ほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153488-153521">しくございませんから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153521-153536"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153536-153560"><rb>後程</rb><rt>のちほど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153560-153563">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153563-153581"><rb>頂</rb><rt>いたゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153581-153605">きましやう、）と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153605-153626"><rb>婦人</rb><rt>をんな</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153626-153647"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153647-153650">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153650-153665"><rb>箸</rb><rt>はし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153665-153668">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153668-153680"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153680-153689">らずに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153689-153704"><rb>二</rb><rt>ふた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153704-153710">ツの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153710-153725"><rb>膳</rb><rt>ぜん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-153725-153728">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-153728-153743"><rb>片</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby>つけてな。」</p>
