></ruby><seg source="#source-173262-173265">一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173265-173280"><rb>重</rb><rt>へ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173280-173283">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173283-173322"><rb>魑魅魍魎</rb><rt>ちみまうりやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173322-173358">といふのであらうか、ざわ</seg><choice source="#source-173358-173364"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-173364-173367">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173367-173379"><rb>木</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173379-173382">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173382-173394"><rb>葉</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173394-173397">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173397-173412"><rb>戦</rb><rt>そよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173412-173415">ぐ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173415-173436"><rb>気色</rb><rt>けしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173436-173450">だつた。</seg></p>
