      <div type="layout" source="#source-174515-174780" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg source="#source-174550-174609">若不順我咒　　悩乱説法者　　頭破作七分</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-174609-174668">如阿梨樹枝　　如殺父母罪　　亦如厭油殃</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-174668-174727">斗秤欺誰人　　調達僧罪犯　　犯此法師者</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-174727-174744">当獲如是殃</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><seg source="#source-174782-174788">と一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174788-174821"><rb>心不乱</rb><rt>しんふらん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174821-174824">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174824-174839"><rb>颯</rb><rt>さツ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174839-174842">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174842-174854"><rb>木</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174854-174857">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174857-174869"><rb>葉</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174869-174872">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174872-174884"><rb>捲</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174884-174890">いて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174890-174905"><rb>風</rb><rt>かぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174905-174908">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174908-174929"><rb>南</rb><rt>みんなみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174929-174932">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174932-174944"><rb>吹</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174944-174956">いたが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174956-174974"><rb>忽</rb><rt>たちま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174974-174977">ち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174977-174995"><rb>静</rb><rt>しづま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174995-174998">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174998-175013"><rb>返</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-175013-175022">つた、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-175022-175043"><rb>夫婦</rb><rt>ふうふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-175043-175046">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-175046-175061"><rb>閨</rb><rt>ねや</rt></ruby>もひツそりした。」</p>
