        <p>「いや、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191714-191726"><rb>先</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191726-191729">づ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191729-191741"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191741-191759">かつしやい、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191759-191771"><rb>彼</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191771-191774">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191774-191798"><rb>孤家</rb><rt>ひとつや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191798-191801">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191801-191822"><rb>婦人</rb><rt>をんな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191822-191837">といふは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191837-191852"><rb>旧</rb><rt>もと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191852-191867">な、これも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191867-191882"><rb>私</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191882-191888">には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191888-191903"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191903-191909">かの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191909-191924"><rb>縁</rb><rt>えん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191924-191945">があつた、あの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191945-191966"><rb>恐</rb><rt>おそろし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191966-191969">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191969-191990"><rb>魔処</rb><rt>ましよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191990-191993">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191993-192008"><rb>入</rb><rt>はい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-192008-192023">らうといふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-192023-192047"><rb>岐道</rb><rt>そばみち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-192047-192050">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-192050-192065"><rb>水</rb><rt>みづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-192065-192068">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right